# driver key or platform|firmware packages
# The firmware each driver needs (2026-10-14 user, WS232 p004: "Intel GPUの
# ドライバも、選択したらファームウェアも選択されるようにお願いします。その
# ほかのドライバも、ファームウェアを選択してください。").  menuconfig adds a
# driver's packages to the Firmware selection when the driver is turned on
# (in Drivers, or as a board's default when a CPU or board is chosen), and
# takes them out when it is turned off unless another driver that is on
# still needs them.  The licenses are still accepted when the image is built.
# A key that is a platform's name (as in ZEDBSD_PLATFORM) names the firmware
# that board needs whatever its drivers are, its bootloader: choosing the
# board selects it and choosing another board takes it out (2026-10-30 user:
# "ODROID-C5のBSPを選ぶと、Amlogicのこのチップのファームウェアが自動で
# 依存関係で有効になるようにしてください。").
CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_I915|i915-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_NVRTX|nvidia-gsp-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_INTEL_AX211|intelax211-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_RTL8822BU|rtl8822b-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_USB_BT|intelbt-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_BCM2711_WIFI|bcm43455-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_BCM2711_BT|brcmbt-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_PCI_AMDRDNA|amd-navi-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_POWERVR|powervr-firmware
CONFIG_DRIVER_MALI_GPU|mali-csf-firmware
odroid-c5|amlogic-s7d-bootloader
